# GitHub Actions: Wix CLI preview

Copy this workflow into the **site repo Wix creates**, not only this kit.
Store `WIX_CLI_API_KEY` as a GitHub Actions secret on that repo.

```yaml
name: Wix preview
on:
  pull_request:
    branches: [main, master]
jobs:
  preview:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: "20"
      - run: npm install
      - run: npm run wix login -- --api-key ${{ secrets.WIX_CLI_API_KEY }}
      - run: npm run wix preview
```

Docs: https://dev.wix.com/docs/develop-websites/articles/workspace-tools/developer-tools/git-integration-wix-cli/set-up-git-hub-actions-to-work-with-the-wix-cli
